2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M2.11, S4): the hair and beard overlays (DCC/Looks.h, docs/architecture/art-pipeline.md "Sprites").
# A character's IE_DCC_HAIR / IE_DCC_BEARD (the CRE extension's CHAR record) picks a row by ID and KIND
# (0 none: a body with its hair baked in, or a bald one). CODE is the overlay's 2-letter animation code: its
# BAMs are WQ<size><code><suffix>, drawn like a helmet's over the body and coloured by the hair range. HELMET
# is what is drawn while a helmet is worn: a cropped style's code (X?: the style cut at the helmets' rim, so
# what hangs below still shows), the style itself (beards), or * for nothing (short styles). S5: CLOSED is the
# same under a closed helmet (dcchelm.2da: the armet, down to the neck): a crop of its own, Y? for the hair
# cropped X? (* for the rest) and Z? for the beards. A code with no BAMs draws nothing. S7: under a hood (dcchelm.2da
# CLOSED 2, RH) the HOOD column is drawn instead: for every hair style EA, the elves' pointed ears (drawn under the
# hood, so only the tips out of its outline show; only the elf rigs E V have EA files, so elsewhere nothing), for a
# beard its own CODE (the hood leaves the face bare). Without the column: no hair, the beard its CODE.
# Each style is rendered on one rig only, so it draws only on that rig's bodies (the size letter): hair 1-7
# and the beards on the male (L: CPM2), hair 8-13 on the female (F: CPF2). The looks roll (dcclooks.2da)
# picks them by sex; elsewhere the file is missing and nothing is drawn. S6: every hair style is rendered on
# each demihuman rig of its sex too (D W E V); the dwarven beards 4-6 on the dwarf man (D) only. Halflings
# have no rigs of their own: they are drawn on the dwarves' (D W, avatars.2da). S5: the elves' bodies have
# human ears; their pointed ears are drawn in every hair style on the elf rigs (E V), so a helmet's crop hides
# them. 14 is a bald elf's (dcclooks.2da BARE): the ears alone, on both elf rigs only, nothing under a helmet.
               ID   KIND   CODE  HELMET  CLOSED  HOOD
SIMPLE_PARTED  1    HAIR   HP    *       *       EA
BALDING        2    HAIR   HA    *       *       EA
BUZZED         3    HAIR   HZ    *       *       EA
DREADS         4    HAIR   HD    XD      YD      EA
MOHAWK         5    HAIR   HM    *       *       EA
PONYTAIL       6    HAIR   HT    XT      YT      EA
SLICKBACK      7    HAIR   HS    *       *       EA
BOB            8    HAIR   HO    XO      YO      EA
BUNS           9    HAIR   HN    *       *       EA
BUZZED_F       10   HAIR   HY    *       *       EA
LONG           11   HAIR   HL    XL      YL      EA
LONG_DREADS    12   HAIR   HR    XR      YR      EA
PONYTAIL_F     13   HAIR   HQ    XQ      YQ      EA
BALD           14   HAIR   EA    *       *       EA
FULL_BEARD     1    BEARD  BD    BD      ZD      BD
MOUSTACHE      2    BEARD  BM    BM      ZM      BM
MUTTON_CHOPS   3    BEARD  BC    BC      ZC      BC
DWARF_LONG     4    BEARD  BL    BL      ZL      BL
DWARF_FORKED   5    BEARD  BF    BF      ZF      BF
DWARF_SPADE    6    BEARD  BS    BS      ZS      BS
